WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.250
Chara-su!

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.270
Is everyone shugo-shugo-peppy
today?

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.570
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.240
Let's all enjoy it!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.650
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.100
Unlock!

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.550
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.060
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.860
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.730
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.580
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.460
you're like a dream.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.310
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.200
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.040
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.840
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.640
Whenever I start something new

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.350
I get really excited,

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:47.020
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:50.160
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:57.800
I think it'd be nice if I could
just be honest with myself.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.590
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:05.720
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:10.340
It's party time!

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:14.090
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:17.830
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:22.030
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:25.240
It's party time!

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:28.950
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:32.460
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:37.090
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:39.050
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.890
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:51.500
"Shugo Chara Television Shopping!"

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.700
Shugo Chara Television Shopping!

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:59.420
Is everyone doing well-dechu?

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:01.730
Cute, convenient, and low low prices...

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:03.840
It's time for Shugo Chara Television
Shopping-dechu!

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.070
Yay!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:08.480
Now, the product we'll be introducing
to you today...

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:11.450
It's great! Totally "saikou!"

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:14.040
We haven't even brought out
the product yet-dechu.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:17.000
My bad... My timing was totally off!

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:20.240
The product we'll be introducing
to you today...

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.210
It's everyone's best friend,
the little duckie!

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.770
Wow, it's a duck! Great!

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:29.030
Please bring it down a notch.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:33.000
Now then, this little duckie isn't
just good for decoration,

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:40.080
you can train those difficult to reach muscles
by rocking it back and forth-dechu!

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.990
Wow! This rocking rocks!

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:45.640
H-Hey, that's dangerous-dechu!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.310
Cool...

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.560
Let's move on to the
next product, baby!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.910
The audience is waiting for it!

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:58.110
Then, the next item
we'll introduce is...

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.060
A tightrope-dechu!

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.490
Nice! Sweet!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.950
Look what you can do!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.770
Hey, hey! Get close to me
and you'll get hurt!

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:10.970
Get away from me!

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:13.410
Can't do that! I'm outta-control!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.800
Cool...

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:20.240
Hey, hey... Why so angry?

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:22.840
Cheer up and move on
to the next product!

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.740
The next item we will introduce is...

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.080
I can't wait!

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.470
My heart is beating "hurry up!"

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.900
...we will introduce is...

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:31.540
Ah, I can't stand it!

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.140
Nobody can stop my beat!

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.270
Great products!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.540
Nice products!

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.490
Producers produce the products!

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:39.280
Yo!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.250
What could the next product, be?

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.150
We're having a blowout on annoying
Rhythms-dechu.

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:50.920
With every purchase you'll receive an annoying
high-strung Rhythm-dechu!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.650
Order now and receive a giggling
Kusukusu as a gift!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.430
That's not cool, that's <i>cold</i>,
baby!

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.920
Operators are on the line now!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.700
She says they're on the line, but...

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.330
Yeah...

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.580
Maybe I should place an order?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.700
Stay tuned for more fun
products-dechu!

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.930
See you again!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:16.310
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!
Character Introductions!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.620
The first person we'll introduce is...

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.110
Hiiragi Rikka!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:26.740
Rikka is a second year student at Seiyo
Academy and a Guardian Apprentice!

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:29.580
She's always full of energy!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:36.870
Rikka has a mysterious power to understand
what X Eggs are thinking.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.420
I wonder when her Guardian
Egg will be born?

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.410
The second person we'll introduce is...

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:52.470
Ichinomiya Hikaru!

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:59.840
As the President of Easter, Hikaru used
to fight against the Guardians.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:03.790
But he's now transferred to Seiyo
Academy as a first year student.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.320
Now he's friends with Amu-chan
and the others!

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:11.790
Being close to everyone is helping him
learn human kindness and warmth.

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:17.630
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedias each week!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.110
Look forward to them!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:26.130
Shugo-shugo Open Heart Game!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:26.600
Okay!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:31.600
We're going to do another personality test to
find out the truth about yourself today!

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.300
All you watching at home,
play along, 'kay?

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:36.440
Now, the question:

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:44.150
Who would you like to go to a fancy restaurant
with among these choices?

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.480
Ikuto!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.950
With Hikaru-kun.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.890
It's hard to choose, but...
with Tadase-kun.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:53.250
Nagihiko.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:56.630
Has everyone at home
made up their minds?

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.730
Now it's time to announce the results!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.470
What we'll find out today is...

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:11.700
How much do you love yourself?

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.860
First, for the people that chose Ikuto...

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:23.690
Always positive

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.750
You really love yourself!

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.890
Clover, do you love yourself?

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.360
Yes, I do!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.680
Next, for those of you
that chose Tadase...

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.140
You are disappointed in yourself a lot!

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:32.600
Diamond... Do you lack self-confidence
sometimes?

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.750
Yes...

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:37.420
That's just because you're
too hard on yourself.

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.740
Have more self-confidence
and you'll be fine!

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:40.830
Okay!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.180
Next, for those of you
that chose Hikaru...

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:45.700
You both like and dislike
yourself equally!

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:49.760
Being praised makes you happy

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:47.660
Heart, is that right?

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:49.060
Yes, that's right.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.590
Finally, for those of you
that chose Nagihiko...

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.460
You're a secret narcissist!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:55.520
What?

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.140
No, no, no, no...

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.750
You don't show it in front of people
because you're embarrassed,

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.880
but deep down in your heart
you think you're amazing.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.240
Like, she poses in front
of a mirror and stuff...

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.050
No, I don't!

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.540
Okay!

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:14.120
Today we found out that Spade
is a secret narcissist!

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:15.460
No, I'm not! It's wrong!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.230
Yay!

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.010
No, don't say yay!

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:21.000
How about for everyone at home?

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.700
Until the next shugo-shugo
open heart game!

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:25.920
It's wrong!

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.000
Wrong!

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.490
Really wrong!

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.510
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:40.390
"Advice Squad - Part 1."

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.730
What's the matter?

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.280
I'm troubled...

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:51.250
Should I really express these
feelings of mine to Kiseki?

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.010
Love troubles?

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:55.100
But...

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:55.820
But?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:00.550
If he says okay, then I'd have to
give up on Rhythm, wouldn't I?

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:03.420
Wants it all, doesn't she?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.140
What in the world should I do?

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.010
Miki...

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.660
Dia...

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:11.960
You're lost, aren't you?

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:16.050
Try listening to what your
heart is saying...

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:21.990
Now matter how dark the night sky is spread out
before you, there are always shining stars...

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:26.540
If you gaze at the sparkling stars, and focus
your eyes, you should be able to see it...

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.190
Be able to see the sparkle
in your heart!

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:30.390
Um...

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:32.880
I don't understand at all.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.860
Just leave the interpreting to Ran!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:37.060
Don't worry, and just confess!

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:42.240
If you don't know which one to choose, then
how about confessing to both of them!

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:43.610
Isn't that right, Dia?

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:46.120
Dia wouldn't say something like that!

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.190
She'd say something
more complicated...

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:49.550
Exactly, Ran!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:53.010
But, what if I'm turned down
by both of them...

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:58.350
Like dandelion fluff dancing on a gust of
wind, you know not your own fate.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:03.960
But no matter what place you may end up,
you can bloom into a wonderful flower!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.180
You'll feel better once
you get an answer!

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:10.230
And you might find another love!

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.390
I suppose...

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:16.590
The infinite possibilities within you...

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:18.210
The expanding world...

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.100
The you you do not know is
surely there, somewhere.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:23.380
Believe in yourself and just go for it!

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:24.680
So there you have it...

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:28.830
Now me and Dia will give
worrying Miki a cheer!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.680
Go, go, Miki!

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:32.720
You can do it, you can do it, Miki!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:37.340
I don't really get it, but
I'm full of confidence!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.010
Thank you! I'm gonna go for it!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.520
And that's it for Ran...

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:41.350
...and Dia's...

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:44.100
...Advice Squad!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.220
Dismissed!

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:48.430
Kiseki, Rhythm!

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:50.750
I don't think this is going to go well...

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:53.350
Miki!

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:55.050
Your heart is also...

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.700
...sparkling!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.870
See you again!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.160
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.040
Today's episode is "Who I want to be!"

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.040
A new Guardian Character will appear!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.400
I can't wait!

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:29.150
What's really important?

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:35.200
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:42.460
and even if they don't know it,
everyone has one in their heart.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:53.800
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:58.520
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian
Characters and X Characters...

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:02.890
They're all precious things.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:07.060
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.590
Everything'll be okay.

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:11.650
Because even if you feel lost,

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:15.080
you're not alone.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.240
We'll always be together.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:19.880
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:22.910
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:26.090
Open Heart, now!

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:27.750
You can see the eggs, right?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:32.760
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:38.600
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.820
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.980
13 - Who I want to be!

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.980
Amu-chan, this way!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.590
Why'd you run off all of a sudden?

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:54.440
I sensed something amiss.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.680
An X Egg?

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.470
No, I can't really place it.

00:11:58.470 --> 00:11:59.720
Over there!

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:10.530
Hey, what's the matter?

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:11.660
Are you okay?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.840
This girl doesn't have a heart's egg!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:18.060
It became an X Egg and flew off.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.660
Is this yours?

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:29.030
I'm no good.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.640
No good...

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:33.440
Maybe something happened.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:37.560
Perhaps the X Egg broke
her stuffed animal.

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.530
That heart's egg is this
girl's would-be self.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.280
Her would-be self has flown away.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:48.700
I wonder what happened
to the X Egg that left?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.230
At this rate it might become lost.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:54.190
Let's search for her egg.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.220
Sure!

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:56.190
Yeah.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.040
But where could it have gone?

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.510
Maybe it's...

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:06.140
Excuse me, let me borrow
this for a second!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.430
It's dangerous by yourself!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.360
I'll go with her!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:11.890
I'm counting on you, Dia!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.490
Let's search ourselves.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:14.150
Okay.

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:16.110
Kiseki, you watch over her.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:21.190
Indeed! You commoners leave
this up to the King!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:23.930
Wait, Rikka-chan!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:25.510
Dia!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:27.300
Where are you trying to go?

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:30.560
Well, I just forgot something, so...

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:31.590
Forgot something?

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.720
Is this where you live, Rikka-chan?

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:35.710
Y-Yeah, but...

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:41.490
I can sense X Eggs!

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:44.060
T-T-That's just your i-i-imagination!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:46.340
It's my pets' fault!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:47.820
Your pets?

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:51.360
Right! I forgot to feed my pets...

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:55.520
I've got like catfish and tarantulas
and crocodiles and...

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:56.820
Catfish?

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:58.020
Tarantula?

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:58.900
Crocodile?

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:04.170
You're dinky, Dia, so they might
mistake you for their meal!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.400
Anyway, just wait right there, 'kay?

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:12.120
Maybe that's why I feel this strange
sensation like X Eggs...

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:15.160
Attention please!

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:19.840
Whoever recognizes this stuffed
animal, speak up!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.640
Guess it's not here.

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:28.050
X Egg, come on out!

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.720
Where are you?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.840
I don't feel it anywhere around here.

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:35.690
Wait... We'll find it for you!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.370
I'll make sure to protect you.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:42.010
I can't...

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:43.020
I can't...

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.410
It's not here.

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:49.310
Where could it have gone?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:57.600
I wonder what it feels like to put
an X on your would-be self?

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:03.920
I don't really know who I want to
be, so I can't even imagine it.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:07.420
I'm sure your would-be self is somewhere
inside you, Rikka-chan.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:13.190
You may not notice it, but it
sleeps inside of everyone.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:17.650
One day you'll be able to notice
that radiance, Rikka-chan.

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:18.140
I'm sure of it.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.450
Inside of me, too?

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:26.530
I wonder who it is I want to be?

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.880
Rikka-chan!

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.990
I can sense an X Egg!

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:47.380
It's stealing everyone's willpower!

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:51.290
It seems different than
the usual X Egg...

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.720
Such a strong feeling of sadness...

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:56.890
Hey!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.600
You can't go doing that!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.860
So you are that girl's X Egg!

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.290
Hurry and go back to her!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.210
Watch out, Rikka!

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:26.040
Amu-senpai!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.330
I've told you again and again;
it's dangerous by yourself!

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:29.510
I'm sorry...

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:30.960
Dia!

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:33.160
Everyone!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.490
Are you okay, Rikka-chan?

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:34.930
Yes.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.990
So, is that her X Egg?

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.310
Yes, and it's more powerful than usual.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:41.330
Be careful.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:47.270
Tadase-kun, take care of Rikka.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.300
Understood.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.520
I can't...

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.790
I can't...

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:06.630
I can't...

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:07.950
That voice...

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:11.150
I tried, but I couldn't...

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:14.840
Violin, calligraphy, piano...

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:19.350
I wanted to do them all,

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.900
but I gave up easily...

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:28.060
And when my beloved Mi-chan's
ear came off...

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.570
I couldn't do it right...

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:38.190
And I gave up, yet again.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.170
I hate myself for this.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:46.100
I give up on everything so easily.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:47.800
For someone like me...

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.150
For someone like me...

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.600
Don't give up! You can do it!

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:07.940
You go for it, and go for it,
and give it your all!

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.860
And I'm sure you'll become someone
who doesn't give up easily!

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:18.860
Why?

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.710
You don't have to try so hard.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:31.920
Amu-chan?

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.750
So what if you can't do it at first?

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:42.640
One day when you're older,
you might be able to do it.

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:47.780
Trying hard can tire you out.

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:50.610
There's no reason to force it.

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:53.570
Just go along at your own pace.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.840
And be that person you want to be.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.370
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:08.140
Open Heart!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.170
That's...

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:37.030
It hatched into a Guardian Character!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.360
Pleased to meet you!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.600
Who are you?

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:43.780
I'm your would-be self.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:46.040
The Guardian Character Mi!

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:49.560
I do my best, nice and slow...

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:52.430
Nice to meet you, Yuka-chan!

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:53.630
Mi?

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:57.460
Right. I have the same
name as your bunny.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.550
That voice...

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:03.110
Calm down and go slow... Go slow...

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:06.740
I could hear you when
I was fixing Mi-chan.

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:11.890
But, I gave up again...

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.660
Don't worry!

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:18.630
We'll be together from now on.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.910
There's no reason to hurry.

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:29.670
Let's take our time and slowly, gradually, eventually,
turn into a girl who can do anything!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:41.180
I'll always be together
with you, Yuka-chan.

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:42.120
Okay!

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.150
Here.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:56.480
Guardian Characters sure are nice...

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.410
Thank you very much!

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.320
Stay well!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:22.340
It's really rough to place
an X on yourself.

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:27.230
That's why I want to return
every X Egg to its owner.

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:31.140
Even with an X on it, that doesn't change
the fact that it's who you want to be.

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:37.120
Who I want to be...

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:42.160
I wonder who I want to be?

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:46.750
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:50.620
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:55.060
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:01.440
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune!

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:03.410
First, for those of you who chose Dia...

00:22:03.410 --> 00:22:06.570
Four shugoluck stars, super lucky!

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:10.470
You'll discover a new side to your friends,
and become even closer!

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.150
Ran's egg is three shugoluck stars.

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:16.070
You'd do well playing with lots of friends!

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:16.370
You might meet someone new!

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:18.850
Miki's egg is two shugoluck stars.

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:21.120
Teamwork builds friendship!

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:21.420
Deepen your friendship
through sports!

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:24.590
Finally, for those of you
that chose Su's egg...

00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:27.980
You get, um, one shugoluck star.

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:30.890
You might have trouble being
asked for too many favors!

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:33.450
If it's something you can't do, say so!

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:35.860
Your lucky item is a scarf!

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:40.510
Today sure was fun!

00:22:40.510 --> 00:22:42.860
See you next Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:46.170
Lock on: Open Heart!

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:47.720
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together!
That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together!
It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
